Chapter: HdaTone
  cites Kernel chapter HdaAudio

   build/compile.ps1 -Src codex/test/apps/hda-tone.codex -Out t.cdx -Log t.log
   tools/codex-vm.exe -kernel t.cdx -mem 3072

Section: Body

  opening : [Console, Audio] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni "codex beeps"
    r <- hda-play-tone 660 20
    print-line-uni "done"
  end
